      "content": "\"level the playing field\" sounds a bit optimistic when you can't even afford the equipment to play. it feels like the regulations are written by people who don't actually run shops. do you think it's fair that much of the burden falls on small family businesses instead of the massive corporations that actually drive most of the emissions?",
